        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.782,
            0.104,
            0.899,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": "MATHEMATICS"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.142,
            0.128,
            0.156
          ],
          "content": "or,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.399,
            0.139,
            0.536,
            0.157
          ],
          "content": "a + 2d = 600",
          "image_source": "images/page_19_equation_3.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.165,
            0.14,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": "and"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.393,
            0.164,
            0.537,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": "a + 6d = 700",
          "image_source": "images/page_19_equation_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.189,
            0.632,
            0.208
          ],
          "content": "Solving these equations, we get $d = 2 5$ and $a = 5 5 0$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.214,
            0.633,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": "Therefore, production of TV sets in the first year is 550."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.239,
            0.192,
            0.258
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Now"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.432,
            0.239,
            0.766,
            0.261
          ],
          "content": "a_{10}=a+9d=550+9\\times 25=775",
          "image_source": "images/page_19_equation_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.265,
            0.567,
            0.285
          ],
          "content": "So, production of TV sets in the 10th year is 775."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.31,
            0.198,
            0.329
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Also,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.44,
            0.298,
            0.728,
            0.337
          ],
          "content": "S_{7} = \\frac{7}{2} \\left[ 2 \\times 550 + (7 - 1) \\times 25 \\right]",
          "image_source": "images/page_19_equation_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.469,
            0.354,
            0.713,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": "=   \\frac{7}{2} \\begin{bmatrix} 1100 + 150 \\end{bmatrix}  = 4375",
          "image_source": "images/page_19_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.405,
            0.67,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": "Thus, the total production of TV sets in first 7 years is 4375."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.409,
            0.45,
            0.591,
            0.469
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "EXERCISE 5.3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.48,
            0.463,
            0.498
          ],
          "content": "**1.** Find the sum of the following APs:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.504,
            0.422,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": "(i) 2, 7, 12, . . ., to 10 terms."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.515,
            0.503,
            0.807,
            0.523
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $-37,-33,-29,\\cdots,  to  12   terms .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.534,
            0.463,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": "(iii) 0.6, 1.7, 2.8, . . ., to 100 terms."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.509,
            0.526,
            0.804,
            0.564
          ],
          "content": "(iv) $\\frac{1}{15}, \\frac{1}{12}, \\frac{1}{10}, \\ldots,  to  11   terms .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.562,
            0.403,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": "**2.** Find the sums given below :"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.587,
            0.423,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": "(i) $7+10\\frac{1}{2}+14+\\cdots+84$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.516,
            0.598,
            0.742,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $34+32+30+\\cdots+10$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.633,
            0.484,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": "(iii) $-5+(-8)+(-11)+\\cdots+(-230)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.656,
            0.24,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": "**3.** In an AP:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.679,
            0.558,
            0.699
          ],
          "content": "(i) given $a=5,d=3,a_{n}=50,$ find n and $\\mathbf { S } _ { n ^ { * } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.702,
            0.525,
            0.721
          ],
          "content": "(ii) g $\\mathrm{i}\\mathrm{v}\\mathrm{en} a = 7, a_{13}^{-} = 35$ , find $d \\operatorname { a n d } \\operatorname { S } _ { 1 3 ^ { \\circ } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.724,
            0.521,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": "(iii) g $\\mathrm{i} \\underline{\\mathrm{v}} \\underline{\\mathrm{e}}_{12} = 37, d = 3$ , find a and $S _ { 1 2 ^ { \\bullet } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.967,
            0.563,
            0.982
          ],
          "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.746,
            0.544,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": "(iv) g $\\mathrm{i}\\bar{\\mathrm{v}}\\bar{\\mathrm{e}}\\bar{\\mathrm{n}}\\bar{a}_{3}=15,\\bar{\\mathrm{S}}_{10}=125$ , find d and $a _ { \\mathrm { 1 0 ^ { \\circ } } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.768,
            0.507,
            0.787
          ],
          "content": "(v) $\\mathrm{given} d = 5, S_{9} = 75, \\mathrm{find} a \\mathrm{and} a_{9}.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.79,
            0.565,
            0.809
          ],
          "content": "(vi) g $\\mathrm{iven} a = 2, d = 8, S_{n} = 90,$ find n and $a _ { n ^ { * } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.811,
            0.576,
            0.831
          ],
          "content": "(vii) g $\\mathrm{i}\\mathrm{ven} a = 8, a_{n} = 62, S_{n} = 210,$ find n and d."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.834,
            0.573,
            0.853
          ],
          "content": "(viii) g $\\mathrm{iven} a_{n}=4, d=2, \\mathrm{S}_{n}=-14,$ find n and a."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.856,
            0.505,
            0.874
          ],
          "content": "(ix) g $\\mathrm{i}\\mathrm{v}\\mathrm{en} a = 3, n = 8, \\mathrm{S} = 192,$ find d."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.878,
            0.697,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": "(x) g $\\mathrm{i}\\mathrm{ven} l = 28,\\; \\mathrm{S} = 144,$ and there are total 9 terms. Find $^ { a . }$"
        }
      ]
